8. She schedules her streams by trying to fit in as many as possible, showing a tendency toward over-scheduling. (Verbatim: "when i make my schedule i do think how many can i fit in how many how many how many is the maximum what's the maximum number of streams i can squeeze into my schedule")

9. She prioritizes not overlapping streams with family events, indicating family commitments are important to her. (Verbatim: "i also have to really check my calendar because oh my god i need to make sure i don't overlap any like family events or anything")

10. She values rest and self-care, both for herself and encourages it for others, recognizing the importance of health over content output. (Verbatim: "don't ever worry about taking a break if you don't feel well... rest is needed") [end of text]



